{
  "adaptations": [
    "Native port of Fast KV Compaction via Attention Matching (scope, 24-article QuALITY subset and metric definitions from the authoring proposal); reference AM variants stubbed in the public tree; fixed-target median gate with calibration HOLD.",
    "Restore owner-write on the trusted disposable variant entry only; use 3600s TRAIN and 5400s FINAL after article22462 smoke; operator calibration budget increased to 45 H100-hours.",
    "Reuse sealed calibration captures when certified measurement files match; record original/current judge hashes and capture-local anchors; measure only missing articles without changing scientific gates.",
    "Require only three reference calibration jobs; optional diagnostics not_run do not block READY; scientific scoring unchanged.",
    "Anchor drift is recorded only, no calibration/evaluation consistency-band rejection; reference/selftest diagnostics never block READY. Same GPU and own-instance scaling retained; scoring unchanged. Existing sealed captures reused with postmeasurement-only compatibility proof.",
    "Publish READY calibration with10 original sealed captures reused and24 required reference captures completed; selftest/variants not_run; original/current judge hashes retained; measured capture wall time fits3600s TRAIN/5400s FINAL budgets."
  ],
